    "de": [
      "Kunstatelier, das das ganze Jahr über für alle Bevölkerungsgruppen geöffnet ist. Kreativitäts-Coaching, Coaching in narrativen Praktiken zum Lebensbaum, Kunsttherapie."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Art workshop open all year round to all publics. Coaching in creativity, coaching in narrative practices on the Tree of Life, Art therapy."
    ],
